            "review_text": "Crazymonkey20082001\nHanoi, Vietnam24 contributions\n0\nA good restaurant\nNov 2014 • Family\nI came here a few days ago with my family. The restaurant \"s decor made you feel like you\"re in Japan. The food was average, the sushi doesn\"t feel very fresh. But the tempura was good though. The astmostphere was good, too. It makes you feel all warm and cozy. The staff were friendly but they were a little bit slow. Another aspec about the food that it was presented very nicely. I'd recomend it for anyone. I really enjoy it. Thanks for the meal. :)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 14, 2014",
